2026-11-01  Corwin Brust  <corwin@bru.st>

	Coverage of inputloop, accessibility, and egad.

	* AGENTS.md: who commits, where work lands.
	* examples/inputloop/: 37 TOPOLOGY.md files (eight hosts, the two
	forges, twelve projects with components and tools, three paths, three
	people); four private projects say private: hide.
	* spec/fixtures/examples.json, tests/make-examples-fixture.mjs,
	tests/js/examples.test.mjs, perl/Topology/t/70-examples.t: the shared
	test of the examples under both readers.
	* www/css/egad.css: egad's tokens (light, dark).  www/css/topology.css:
	maps them (the default palette), adds --control and --focus, keeps the
	first palette as data-palette="original", adds a reduced-motion rule.
	* www/js/look.js: applies the person's look before the page draws.
	* www/app.html: main, h1, aside, second skip link, noscript, palette
	and light/dark choices, wizard headings under the h1, focus returned.
	* www/index.html: skip target takes focus, pre blocks reachable.
	* tests/a11y-check.mjs: WCAG 2.1 AA rules, 13 planted faults.
	* RECIPE.org, bin/test.sh: run the new checks.
	* README.org, spec/TOPOLOGY-md.md, REUSE.toml, perl/Topology/MANIFEST.

2026-10-31  Corwin Brust  <corwin@bru.st>

	First version, on the corwin branch of inputloop/topology.

	* context/: the request verbatim, the sources read, a review of the
	2026-10-31 recording with Bridget and three ENHANCE pages for C4's
	transcript tools, and FOR-OTHERS.md.
	* perl/Topology/: Topology::Config, ::Doc, ::Repo, ::Graph,
	::Taxonomy, ::Build, ::CSV, ::Server; script/topology,
	script/topology-askpass; t/ (159 tests, under perl 5.44.0 and 5.38.2);
	doc/CLASSIC-BRIDGE.pod.
	* www/: the front door, the app, topology-core.js, the stylesheet, and
	TopoForge 1.7 unchanged.
	* spec/TOPOLOGY-md.md, spec/fixtures/showprivate.json: the format and
	the show-private rule, with cases both languages run.
	* taxonomy/pillars.json, design/TAXONOMY.org: four pillars, two axes,
	six tensions.
	* design/: DESIGN and LENS pages.
	* RECIPE.org: tangles bin/, debian/, etc/, vendor/ORDER and
	tests/recipe-check.sh.
	* vendor/: sixteen CPAN tarballs, their sums, VENDOR.org.
	* debian/: topology-www, topology-perl, topology.
	* runcards/RUNCARD-2026-10-31-gw26.md.
